  Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data 2026.
  Level-2A scenes of July and August 2026, accessed through Earth Search (Element 84) on the Registry of Open Data on
  AWS. Legal notice: https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice

EMODnet Bathymetry (İstanbul water depth)
  EMODnet Bathymetry Consortium (2024): EMODnet Digital Bathymetry (DTM 2024).
