San Francisco (US public domain and open data)
  - USGS 3D Elevation Program (3DEP): terrain. Public domain. Courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey.
  - USDA National Agriculture Imagery Program (NAIP): aerial imagery, roof colours, minimap. Public domain.
    USDA Farm Production and Conservation Business Center.
  - NOAA NCEI DEM Global Mosaic: bay bathymetry. Public domain. NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information.
