  originals, the licence text and their provenance are in tools/audio/third_party/flightgear/ (LICENSE-GPL-2.0.txt,
  NOTICE.md) and tools/audio/third_party/CREDITS.txt.

ElevenLabs
  Some voices and sound effects were generated with ElevenLabs (paid plan). No real person's voice was cloned. They
  are included in the asset pack under its licence, CC BY-NC 4.0 (ASSETS-LICENSE.md).

Synthesised sounds
  The other sounds (engines, rotor, wind, systems, chimes, warning tones) are synthesised by the project's own scripts
  in tools/audio/.

Reference recordings (not distributed)
  Some recordings were used only to measure levels and spectra; none of their audio is in the game. They are listed
  in tools/audio/third_party/CREDITS.txt (Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 3.0 / CC BY 3.0; U.S. Navy and U.S. Air Force
  footage, public domain).


6. Aircraft drawings
--------------------

All aircraft, airport, landmark and city models are generated by the project's own Blender Python scripts. They were
drawn from public drawings and dimensions: Airbus A320 airport-planning documentation; an F-16 three-view by Marek Cel
(CC0); a U.S. Air Force F-22 three-view (public domain). Photos listed in blender/**/ref/SOURCES* were used as visual
reference only and are not distributed.


